## 2. Technology Selection Decision Matrix

Choosing the right development platform is a strategic engineering decision governed by application requirements.

| Decision Criteria | Native Android (Kotlin) | Native iOS (Swift) | React Native (TypeScript) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Primary Use Case** | Deep OS integration, hardware sensors, high-throughput background services. | Apple Ecosystem apps, WidgetKit, Apple Pay, WatchOS extensions. | Cross-platform business workflow apps, rapid MVP iteration, shared web/mobile logic. |
| **UI Framework** | Jetpack Compose (Declarative) | SwiftUI (Declarative) | React Native JSX + StyleSheet |
| **State Management** | `StateFlow` + ViewModel | `@Observable` ViewModel | Custom Hooks + Zustand / Redux |
| **Async Model** | Kotlin Coroutines & Flow | Swift Concurrency (`async`/`await`) | JavaScript Promises & async/await |
| **Dependency Injection** | Hilt / Dagger | Swift Protocol Injections | React Context / Factory DI |

